      "cases": [
        "Cumulative and interval recovery once, duplicate arrivals and16-bit sequence wrap",
        "Expired sequence after a report cannot cancel a new gap sharing its slot",
        "Expired sequence before a report cannot hide that new gap; jitter timestamp still updates",
        "Reorder before the first loss report creates no recovery credit"
      ]
